WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:13.913
BRIAN: LATEST STAY-AT-HOME ORDER

00:00:13.915 --> 00:00:15.101
BRIAN: LATEST STAY-AT-HOME ORDER

00:00:15.103 --> 00:00:18.632
IS IN EFFECT AND SPARKING FURY

00:00:18.666 --> 00:00:21.231
AMONG GOLDEN STATE RESIDENTS,

00:00:21.266 --> 00:00:23.136
DEPUTIES WILL NOT ENFORCE THE

00:00:23.137 --> 00:00:23.952
SHUTDOWN.

00:00:23.986 --> 00:00:25.615
MATTER OF PERSONAL

00:00:25.649 --> 00:00:25.993
RESPONSIBILITY.

00:00:25.994 --> 00:00:27.961
NOT LAW ENFORCEMENT AND NOW NOT

00:00:27.996 --> 00:00:29.868
LAW ENFORCEMENT SAYING HIS

00:00:29.902 --> 00:00:31.799
ACTIONS ARE IN LINE WITH THE

00:00:31.801 --> 00:00:32.860
CONSTITUTION, THAT SHERIFF JOINS

00:00:32.894 --> 00:00:33.515
US NOW.

00:00:33.516 --> 00:00:36.617
SHERIFF, WHAT BROUGHT YOU TO

00:00:36.618 --> 00:00:37.492
THIS CONCLUSION?

00:00:37.527 --> 00:00:39.321
&gt;&gt; WELL, THERE’S SO MANY FACTORS

00:00:39.356 --> 00:00:41.044
THAT GO INTO IT BUT IT’S BEEN A

00:00:41.078 --> 00:00:41.973
LONG YEAR FOR EVERYBODY.

00:00:41.974 --> 00:00:42.775
WE KNOW THAT.

00:00:42.776 --> 00:00:44.622
IT’S BEEN VERY IMPACTFUL UPON

00:00:44.623 --> 00:00:46.283
ALL OF THE BUSINESSES AND

00:00:46.284 --> 00:00:47.433
RESIDENTS OF ORANGE COUNTY AND

00:00:47.434 --> 00:00:48.007
CALIFORNIA.

00:00:48.008 --> 00:00:50.471
BUT I JUST DON’T THINK THAT IT’S

00:00:50.472 --> 00:00:51.877
SOMETHING THAT FALLS IN LINE

00:00:51.911 --> 00:00:52.928
WITH LAW ENFORCEMENT PRIORITY.

00:00:52.929 --> 00:00:53.745
WE HAVE MANY OTHER

00:00:53.747 --> 00:00:55.377
RESPONSIBILITIES THAT WE ARE

00:00:55.412 --> 00:00:56.353
DEALING WITH, MANY

00:00:56.354 --> 00:01:00.104
RESPONSIBILITIES REALLY AREN’T

00:01:00.105 --> 00:01:05.589
OURS THAT WE ARE DEALING,

00:01:05.590 --> 00:01:09.653
HOMELESSNESS, SUBSTANCE USE

00:01:09.654 --> 00:01:12.416
DISORDER, IT’S NOT ONLY UNFAIR

00:01:12.417 --> 00:01:14.912
TO LAW ENFORCEMENT BUT I DON’T

00:01:14.946 --> 00:01:17.054
THINK IT’S FAIR AND STANDS THE

00:01:17.088 --> 00:01:17.704
CONSTITUTIONAL TEST.

00:01:17.738 --> 00:01:19.942
BRIAN: I DON’T KNOW HOW IT’S

00:01:19.977 --> 00:01:22.478
LIKE IN YOUR COUNTY, WHEN I RUN

00:01:22.512 --> 00:01:24.817
IN RESTAURANT, I SEE PLEXIGLASS,

00:01:24.852 --> 00:01:26.142
SOCIAL DISTANCING, TABLES

00:01:26.143 --> 00:01:27.124
SEPARATING, VOLUNTARY LESS

00:01:27.125 --> 00:01:27.633
CAPACITY.

00:01:27.667 --> 00:01:29.961
THESE OWNERS WANT TO COMPLY.

00:01:29.996 --> 00:01:32.795
ARE YOU NOTICING THE SAME THING?

00:01:32.796 --> 00:01:34.707
&gt;&gt; WE ARE NOTICING EXACTLY THAT.

00:01:34.708 --> 00:01:36.199
EVERY ONE OF THE BUSINESSES THAT

00:01:36.201 --> 00:01:37.254
ARE OPERATING HAVE MET

00:01:37.288 --> 00:01:38.345
EXPECTATIONS OF THE STATE.

00:01:38.346 --> 00:01:40.460
THE STATE HAS COME OUT AND SAID

00:01:40.495 --> 00:01:43.111
THAT IF YOU NEED TO -- IF YOU

00:01:43.145 --> 00:01:45.419
WANT TO CONTINUE OPERATING AS A

00:01:45.454 --> 00:01:46.919
BUSINESS YOU HAVE TO DO THESE

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:48.403
THINGS.

00:01:48.437 --> 00:01:55.021
IT’S LIKE THE GOLD -- GOAL POSTS

00:01:55.055 --> 00:01:57.533
KEEPS MOVING WEEK BY WEEK.

00:01:57.534 --> 00:01:59.774
I HEARD THE STORY THAT YOU

00:01:59.808 --> 00:02:01.783
MENTIONED EARLIER ABOUT IN LOS

00:02:01.818 --> 00:02:05.885
ANGELES WHERE A LADY HAD A TENT

00:02:05.886 --> 00:02:08.360
AND OPERATING IN PARKING LOT AND

00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:10.721
THEY CAN OPERATE AND SHE CANNOT.

00:02:10.723 --> 00:02:12.357
I DON’T KNOW HOW YOU CAN HAVE

00:02:12.391 --> 00:02:13.409
DISPARAGED RULES AND EXPECT

00:02:13.410 --> 00:02:14.739
PEOPLE TO FOLLOW THEM.

00:02:14.740 --> 00:02:16.688
IF THEY FOLLOW THOSE, THEY ARE

00:02:16.690 --> 00:02:18.100
IN ESSENCE PUTTING THEMSELVES

00:02:18.135 --> 00:02:19.593
OUT OF BUSINESS, THEIR

00:02:19.595 --> 00:02:20.862
LIKELIHOOD IS GONE.

00:02:20.864 --> 00:02:24.305
&gt;&gt; WHAT BOTHERS ME OF PEOPLE IN

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:26.249
YOUR PROFESSION, YOU ARE GOING

00:02:26.283 --> 00:02:28.325
THROUGH ENOUGH, THE COPS ARE THE

00:02:28.326 --> 00:02:30.666
BAD GUY AND IT’S YOUR FAULT AND

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:33.262
YOU HAVE TO GO TO LAW ABIDING

00:02:33.296 --> 00:02:35.396
CITIZENS AND TELL THEM THEY

00:02:35.398 --> 00:02:37.505
CAN’T EARN A LIVING, THE TIMING

00:02:37.506 --> 00:02:38.940
COULDN’T BE WORSE, NOT ONLY THE

00:02:38.942 --> 00:02:39.237
MISSION.

00:02:39.238 --> 00:02:41.073
&gt;&gt; THAT’S PART OF THE ISSUE.

00:02:41.107 --> 00:02:42.493
WHEN YOU LOOK AT THIS YEAR FOR

00:02:42.527 --> 00:02:43.796
LAW ENFORCEMENT AFTER

00:02:43.831 --> 00:02:45.399
MINNEAPOLIS AND THE CALIFORNIA

00:02:45.433 --> 00:02:47.847
LEGISLATURE MADE ITS MISSION TO

00:02:47.881 --> 00:02:49.446
DEFUND THE POLICE, CHANGE THE

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:51.851
RULES TO COME OUT WITH NEW

00:02:51.853 --> 00:02:53.359
LEGISLATION AND RESTRICT WAY WE

00:02:53.393 --> 00:02:55.135
CAN DO OUR JOB.

00:02:55.170 --> 00:02:58.644
ON THE ONE HAND, WE WANT YOU TO

00:02:58.645 --> 00:03:00.412
STOP DOING THINGS TO RESULT IN

00:03:00.413 --> 00:03:01.793
ACTIONS FOR THE COMMUNITY BUT

00:03:01.794 --> 00:03:03.276
NOT THIS TIME, RULES ARE

00:03:03.310 --> 00:03:04.639
DIFFERENT AND GO OUT AND ARREST

00:03:04.673 --> 00:03:04.969
PEOPLE.

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:06.634
I’M NOT SURE THAT WE WANT TO BE

00:03:06.635 --> 00:03:07.807
IN A POSITION THAT LAW

00:03:07.842 --> 00:03:09.185
ENFORCEMENT OPERATING WITH THAT

00:03:09.187 --> 00:03:11.451
MISSION IN MIND TO GO OUT AND

00:03:11.485 --> 00:03:13.366
ARREST LAWFUL RESIDENTS OF THE

00:03:13.368 --> 00:03:15.576
COUNTY WHO ARE TRYING TO MAKE

00:03:15.577 --> 00:03:17.071
ENDS MEET AND ARE DOING SO BY

00:03:17.105 --> 00:03:18.353
FOLLOWING THE RULES.

00:03:18.387 --> 00:03:20.119
THE RULES CAN’T CHANGE WEEK BY

00:03:20.153 --> 00:03:21.658
WEEK AND IT’S BEEN DIFFICULT FOR

00:03:21.692 --> 00:03:22.848
OUR CONSTITUENTS IN ORANGE

00:03:22.849 --> 00:03:24.932
COUNTY, THROUGHOUT THE STATE AND

00:03:24.933 --> 00:03:26.516
THE NATION QUITE HONESTLY TO

00:03:26.518 --> 00:03:28.025
KEEP REDEFINING THE WAY WE

00:03:28.027 --> 00:03:29.227
OPERATE.

00:03:29.261 --> 00:03:32.852
BRIAN: SHERIFF, NO DOUBT ABOUT

00:03:32.853 --> 00:03:34.196
IT.

00:03:34.231 --> 00:03:37.331
HOPEFULLY NO RETRIBUTION FROM

00:03:37.333 --> 00:03:37.720
SACRAMENTO.

00:03:37.721 --> 00:03:39.435
SHERIFF, THANK YOU AND HAVE A

00:03:39.436 --> 00:03:40.122
GREAT HOLIDAY.

